Core split now: 
- 5-claim (colleagues 1,4,12) asserts four rectangles give rank(W)=4 hence generic rank(M)=5; 
- 3-claim (2,3,11,15) notes shared column supports (identical left/right white blocks in both top & bottom bands) collapse W to rank 2, yielding exactly three distinct row patterns (all-a outside canton; b-a-b pattern above/below horiz. arm; all-a inside canton on horiz. arm) that are independent for a≠b, so rank(M)=3 attained; 
